  "details": "I am a Quest 3 user and I do enjoy using the Index Simulation when turning off gestures, But I'm unable to grab or interact with any of my avatar's assets (Swords, Guns, Etc) unless I turn on the gesture toggle. I do not know if its intended, But I personally like using the Index Simulation for Quests, but find it a little annoying to have to turn on the gesture toggle every time I want to try out an asset. Same with unable to make a Peace Sign Gesture. I don't see any issues with my controller bindings either if thats the issue (Having gestures turned on works fine as it should for quest, but turning it off there are minor issues)",
